IV. PROPERTY NOT INSURED We do not insure any of the following: 1. Personal property not inside a building; 2. A building, and personal property in it, located entirely in, on, or over water or seaward of mean high tide if it was constructed or substantially improved after September 30, 1982; 3. Open structures, including a building used as a boathouse or any structure or building into which boats are floated, and personal property located in, on, or over water; 4. Recreational vehicles other than travel trailers described in the Definitions section (see II.C.6.c) whether affixed to a permanent foundation or on wheels; 5. Selfp ropelled vehicles or ma c hines, including their parts and equipment.

